<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>For You</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffe6f0, #ffffff);
      overflow-x: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 26px 24px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      text-align: center;
      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #444;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .signature {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #d14c86;
    }

    /* Floating lilies */
    .lily {
      position: fixed;
      font-size: 34px;
      opacity: 0.85;
      animation: floatUp linear infinite;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    @keyframes floatUp {
      from {
        transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(0deg);
      }
      to {
        transform: translateY(-10vh) rotate(360deg);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">
    <p>
      I remember the time when I wasn't looking for love. I was focused on getting through my days and figuring things out on my own but then you came into my life and everything felt different and that makes it special. I can't imagine my life without you, sinanay mo kong nanjan ka palagi para sakin.
    </p>

    <p>
      I'm very grateful to have you and how perfectly unexpected you are. Loving you wasn’t something I chased, it simply happened, and it feels real in a way nothing else ever did.
    </p>

    <p>
      When life isn't being kind to you, always remember na nandito lang ako palagi kasama mo. You don't have to face it alone, we'll face it together, ga. I love you, forever.
    </p>

    <div class="signature">
      Love,<br />AD
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function createLily() {
      const lily = document.createElement("div");
      lily.className = "lily";
      lily.textContent = "🌸"; // pink lily vibe
      lily.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
      lily.style.animationDuration = 10 + Math.random() * 6 + "s";
      document.body.appendChild(lily);

      setTimeout(() => {
        lily.remove();
      }, 16000);
    }

    setInterval(createLily, 700);

    document.addEventListener("click", () => {
      for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) createLily();
    });
  </script>

</body>
